@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Estimate evidence admission path

[Host\n(identities, history, coverage)] as Host
[estimate-evidence.mjs\nEstimateEvidenceRuntime\n(encode/decode only)] as JS
[Rust core\nestimate_evidence::Session\n(1-64 records, no eviction)] as Core
[Native conformance example\n(same GFEE v1 adapter)] as Native

Host --> JS : create / evaluate
JS --> Core : GFEE v1 packet\n(kind 0 create, kind 1 evaluate)
Native --> Core : GFEE v1 packet
Core --> JS : Verdict or Rejection
JS --> Host : snapshot (u64 as decimal strings)
note right of Core
  Admits a declared basis only:
  no numeric estimate, command
  or temporal permission
  (temporalAdmission: false)
end note
@enduml
